/* file-reader 皮肤（音视频）—— 宿主自有：颜色、间距、文案排布都在这里改，模块同步不会覆盖本目录。 */

.media-reader,
.file-inspector {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 24rpx;
  padding: 28rpx;
  border: 3rpx solid #171715;
  border-radius: 28rpx;
  background: #fffdf8;
  box-shadow: 8rpx 8rpx 0 #171715;
}

.media-heading,
.inspector-header {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10rpx;
  margin-bottom: 24rpx;
}

.media-kicker,
.inspector-kicker {
  align-self: flex-start;
  padding: 6rpx 14rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  color: #171715;
  background: #b9e63b;
  font-size: 21rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
}

.media-name,
.inspector-title {
  color: #171715;
  font-size: 36rpx;
  font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 1.25;
  word-break: break-all;
}

.media-meta,
.inspector-summary {
  color: #68645c;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  line-height: 1.55;
  word-break: break-all;
}

.media-diagnostic {
  padding: 12rpx 16rpx;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  color: #504d46;
  background: #f3f5e7;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  line-height: 1.45;
}

.media-compatibility {
  color: #7c321f;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.media-detail-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 6rpx;
  padding: 14rpx 16rpx;
  border-radius: 14rpx;
  background: #f7f3ec;
}

.media-detail {
  color: #504d46;
  font-size: 21rpx;
  line-height: 1.45;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.media-unavailable {
  padding: 24rpx;
  border: 2rpx dashed #9b9588;
  border-radius: 18rpx;
  color: #504d46;
  background: #f7f3ec;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.video-player {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 360rpx;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #171715;
}

.audio-player {
  padding: 26rpx 20rpx 18rpx;
  border-radius: 22rpx;
  background: #f3f5e7;
}

.audio-play-button {
  width: 180rpx;
  margin: 0 auto 20rpx;
  border: 3rpx solid #171715;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  color: #171715;
  background: #ff745f;
  box-shadow: 0 6rpx 0 #171715;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  font-weight: 900;
}

.audio-slider {
  margin: 0;
}

.audio-time {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 0 16rpx;
  color: #68645c;
  font-size: 21rpx;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.local-only-note {
  margin-top: 24rpx;
  color: #68645c;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  text-align: center;
}
